+
+# 2026-11-24-z-released-memory-usage
+
+English | [中文](2026-11-24-z-released-memory-usage.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Readers recognize memory/extraction and the memory-context and memory-extraction message sources written by DSHU v4.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-11-24-z-released-memory-usage
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "426eaa9b7e514edfdce64afc01437bb6b22fee7d59499f2f64d32ed2ea701985"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "b3677b36e945db16dc2ffc8cea0ee1c53f5f6d6fd7b237c6c1bf743da2c20613"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:memory/extraction"
+    previous: null
+    after: "153bbdf973e2e101975b37c2c9a35ad1e26402e7981854f810d937ad348383e6"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "41fff1282d7a7885b5ce83a7da921cea4fc54f11e9c9d43517c264993a4c4b2e"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "8735b024d34a622b2e56d90b63c4109af57b7590d6f78bb943b5c3f9b227c2c2"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+The auxiliary event has no main conversation surface operation. Existing DSHU logs retain their original messages and request identities. The reader accepts the recorded request and result without emitting new records. Earlier upstream readers reject this required event. Session format v4 remains in use.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+The released-data verifier writes a compressed Session using the published DSHU source and reopens a copy twice with the candidate. It compares the main messages and checks the auxiliary fee against the recorded model usage. The Session reader also rejects unknown required events.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
