 ## Use this package
 
+The account menu offers **About** before and after sign-in. On wide screens the brand panel fills the left edge of the dialog. On narrow screens it spans the top. The left panel displays the DSHU calendar version and UTC build time. The right panel identifies the kernel, base commit and date, source tree, release component pins and licenses, with links to the candidate manifest, notices and official DSHU releases. Escape returns focus to the account menu.
